# Extending aayudha (docs/guide/how-extending.md). Rendered to how-extending.svg by go generate.
title: Every extension starts from one declared source, then tests, generation, and a human review
direction: down
verb: New verb: registry entry, skill body, handler
floor: New floor: Floor type, defaults.toml key, gen row
host: New host: registry host, internal/hosts, hosts/
integration: New integration: adapter, providers.Known
tests: go test ./... and go generate ./...
review: CODEOWNERS review of protected paths
verb -> tests
floor -> tests
host -> tests
integration -> tests
tests -> review: pull request to dev
